## §J Fused Router：`fused_router/fused_topk_with_score_function.cu`

MoE 路由的核心：把 score 矩阵 [B*S, E]（每 token 对应 E 个 expert）做 softmax/sigmoid → topk → mask 出 routing 矩阵。TE 用 **warp-per-token** 的策略：

```cpp
template <typename T, int E, int K>
__global__ void fused_topk_with_score_function_forward_kernel(
    const T* __restrict__ logits,    // [N, E]
    T*       __restrict__ probs,     // [N, E] mask 后 routing
    int*     __restrict__ indices,   // [N, K]
    int N,
    ScoreFunc score_fn /* softmax|sigmoid */) {

  const int token = blockIdx.x * (blockDim.y) + threadIdx.y;
  if (token >= N) return;
  const int lane  = threadIdx.x;   // 0..31

  // 1) Load 一行 logits（E ≤ 32 时每 lane 一个 expert，>32 时 lane 处理多个）
  __shared__ float row_softmax[/*warps_per_block*/][E];
  float vals[(E + 31) / 32];
  #pragma unroll
  for (int i = 0; i < (E+31)/32; ++i) {
    int e = lane + i*32;
    vals[i] = (e < E) ? static_cast<float>(logits[token*E + e]) : -INFINITY;
  }

  // 2) 跨 lane reduce max → softmax
  float row_max = vals[0];
  #pragma unroll
  for (int i = 1; i < (E+31)/32; ++i) row_max = fmaxf(row_max, vals[i]);
  row_max = warp_reduce_max(row_max);

  float sum = 0.f;
  #pragma unroll
  for (int i = 0; i < (E+31)/32; ++i) {
    vals[i] = expf(vals[i] - row_max);
    sum += (lane + i*32 < E) ? vals[i] : 0.f;
  }
  sum = warp_reduce_sum(sum);
  float inv_sum = 1.f / sum;
  #pragma unroll
  for (int i = 0; i < (E+31)/32; ++i) vals[i] *= inv_sum;

  // 3) topK：迭代 K 次，每次找当前最大，记下 index 后把它置 -inf
  for (int k = 0; k < K; ++k) {
    float local_max = -INFINITY;
    int   local_arg = -1;
    #pragma unroll
    for (int i = 0; i < (E+31)/32; ++i) {
      int e = lane + i*32;
      if (e < E && vals[i] > local_max) { local_max = vals[i]; local_arg = e; }
    }
    // warp argmax: 用 __shfl_xor_sync 配对比较
    int   arg = warp_argmax(local_max, local_arg, &local_max);
    if (lane == 0) indices[token*K + k] = arg;
    // 把胜出者置 -inf，保留 prob
    if (arg / 32 == lane / 32) {
      int i = arg / 32;
      if (lane == arg % 32) vals[i] = -INFINITY;
    }
  }

  // 4) 输出 probs：未选中位置写 0，选中位置写原 softmax prob
  ...
}
```

`group_limited_topk_with_score_function.cu` 在外面再包一层 "先 group reduce 再 topk_group" 实现 DeepSeek-MoE 的 group-limited topk。

**反向**：因为 topk 是稀疏的，只对入选的 K 个 expert 反传 `dprob_to_dlogit = prob_i * (dprob_i - sum_k prob_k * dprob_k)`（softmax 梯度），未入选 expert 的 dlogit = 0。

